    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Necromage lets you summon a skeleton army to fight and explore a vast, corrupted world. Rise from the underworld to restore what your kind once plunged into chaos. Hunt down and confront your greatest enemy.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891720/extras/9b177dcf6270fa4dc94e7f4df916fcec.poster.avif?t=1754052055\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891720/extras/9b177dcf6270fa4dc94e7f4df916fcec.webm?t=1754052055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891720/extras/9b177dcf6270fa4dc94e7f4df916fcec.mp4?t=1754052055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the art of summoning creatures from all corners of the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft powerful spells to level up and enhance your creatures' gear.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an epic journey through diverse realms: start in the underworld and ascend to the upper world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover and conquer challenging dungeons. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up and equip your main character with the finest gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Necromage lets you summon a skeleton army to fight and explore a vast, corrupted world. Rise from the underworld to restore what your kind once plunged into chaos. Hunt down and confront your greatest enemy.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891720/extras/9b177dcf6270fa4dc94e7f4df916fcec.poster.avif?t=1754052055\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891720/extras/9b177dcf6270fa4dc94e7f4df916fcec.webm?t=1754052055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891720/extras/9b177dcf6270fa4dc94e7f4df916fcec.mp4?t=1754052055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the art of summoning creatures from all corners of the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft powerful spells to level up and enhance your creatures' gear.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an epic journey through diverse realms: start in the underworld and ascend to the upper world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover and conquer challenging dungeons. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up and equip your main character with the finest gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Be a necromancer who can learn to summon any creature from the world. Level up and equip your minions by crafting enchanted spells to use on them. All this takes place in an isometric action-RPG with intense combat and powerful bosses that will require your army of minions to defeat.",
